WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
The admin is done before she arrives.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:07.900
Overnight, her agent read every message,
captured the dates, and drafted the replies.

3
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.700
So the day does not start in the inbox.

4
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.200
Two decisions. One tap each.

5
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.600
Then she leaves.

6
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.600
The morning is for fabric.

7
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.100
The questions that used to wait in her inbox
are being answered while she researches.

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.800
She dictates on the way.

9
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.800
Her agent drafts the confirmation and holds it.

10
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.200
Then it checks the record and asks back:

11
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.800
the lab dip was approved on the eighteenth.

12
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.400
Did she mean another colour?

13
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.250
On the road, she gets a summary,

14
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.550
she does not have to read the whole thread.

15
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.800
The afternoon is for the product.

16
00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.700
A measurement is slightly off.

17
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.800
The photo goes on the order record.

18
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.300
The order’s sub-agent sees it
before anyone writes an email.

19
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.200
Nothing piles up behind her.

20
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.250
The evening is for the customer.

21
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.300
The phone stays face down.

22
00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.300
Every decision she made today is on the record,
in three languages.

23
00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.800
The ones that really needed her
were the ones that reached her.

24
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.500
Nothing waiting on the desk,
because it never piled up there.

25
00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.900
VIA Merch. An agent for every merchandiser.

26
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:10.800
merch.getvia.xyz
